      <p source="#source-550-936"><seg source="#source-550-616">三吉兄ハ此頃御同行ニて薩邸ニ入候間、御安心可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-616-628">レ</note><seg source="#source-628-631">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-631-643">レ</note><seg source="#source-643-772">遣候。然ニ去月伏見船宿寺田屋ニて一宿仕候節、幕府人数と一戦争仕候。其故ハ此度参ル寺内新</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-778-829"><seg source="#source-772-778">右門</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-802-814">（ママ）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-829-853">参候間、御聞取奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-853-865">レ</note><seg source="#source-865-898">願候。餘ハ拝顔の上、万</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-898-931">〻</g><seg source="#source-931-936">。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-936-998" style="padding-inline-start: 3em">
        <p source="#source-957-998"><seg source="#source-957-969">二月三日</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-969-998" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-987-998">謹言。</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-998-1064" style="padding-inline-start: 4em">
        <p source="#source-1019-1064"><seg source="#source-1019-1028">印藤様</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1028-1064" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(1)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=1"><seg source="#source-1058-1064">龍拝</seg></seg></p>
